const faqItems = [
  {
    q: 'What is the best MBA specialization for engineers?',
    a: 'There is no single best specialization. Operations and supply chain management suits mechanical, industrial, and production engineers who already think in processes. Business analytics suits CSE, IT, and EEE engineers comfortable with data and quantitative reasoning. Product management fits engineers who want to stay close to technical products while moving into decision-making roles. Finance suits engineers strong in math who want corporate finance or investment banking. The right choice depends on your branch, your natural work style, and the specific institute\'s placement strength in that specialization, not a generic ranking.',
